# hole1.replay for the TX (320x448 screen, pen in its pixels) with no map
# visits: the swing starts with a tap on the strip, the clicks are taps on the
# scene. Same build (EXTRA=-DPLAY_SEED=3) and timing. Start it on the tee
# view once it's drawn.
# Clicks after each swing start are 250 ms later than the meter times above: on the TX in Frond
# the meter's clock starts about then, once its first frames show. Frond's TX slows under load, so power varies.
